  "solution": "1. ÷ and +\n\n117 + __**13 ÷ 16**__ × 540 - 40 = 644\n\n⇒ 117 + __**0.8125 × 540**__ - 40 = 644\n\n⇒ __**117 + 438.75**__ - 40 = 644\n\n⇒ __**555.75**____** - 40 **__= 644\n\n⇒ 515.75 - 40 ≠ 644\n\n2. + and ×\n\n__**117 ÷ 13**__ × 16 + 540 - 40 = 644\n\n⇒ __**9 ×**____** 16**__** **+ 540 - 40 = 644\n\n⇒ __**144 + 540**__ - 40 = 644\n\n⇒ __**684 - 40**__ = 644\n\n⇒ 644 = 644\n\n3. - and +\n\n__**117 ÷ 13**__ - __**16 × 540**__ + 40 = 644\n\n⇒ __**9**__ - 8640 __**+**____** 40**__ = 644\n\n⇒ __**49**____** -**____** 8640**__ = 644\n\n⇒ -8591 ≠ 644\n\n4. ÷ and -\n\n117 - 13 + 16 × __**540 ÷ 40**__ = 644\n\n⇒ 117 - 13 + __**16 × 13.5**__ = 644\n\n⇒ __**117**__ - 13 __**+ 216**__ = 644\n\n⇒ __**333 -**____** 13**__ = 644\n\n⇒ 320 ≠ 644\n\nHence, ‘**+ and ×**’ is the correct answer.",
